{"id":"visto","lemma":"visto","pos":"adj","rank":169,"glosses":["seen","obvious, clear","exposed, bare"],"ipa":"/ˈbisto/","forms":{"feminine":"vista","masculinePlural":"vistos","femininePlural":"vistas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-visto.wav","formAudio":{"vista":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-vista.wav","vistas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-vistas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¡He visto un ratón!","en":"I saw a mouse!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/212414"},{"text":"Yo aparté la vista.","en":"I looked away.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440322"},{"text":"Atributos masculinos en una mujer son vistos como fuerza, por el contrario, atributos femeninos en un hombre son vistos como debilidad.","en":"Masculine qualities in a woman are seen as strength, while feminine qualities in a man are viewed as weakness."},{"text":"Queremos una casa con vistas al mar.","en":"We want a house with a sea view.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/826107"},{"text":"No hemos visto nada.","en":"We saw nothing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441279"}]}